{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/62216-dragonblooded-charms-3e-or-i-m-not-sure-how-this-ll-work","id":62216,"title":"Dragonblooded charms 3e, Or: I'm not sure how this'll work","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-31T09:01:09-08:00","id":62216,"title":"Dragonblooded charms 3e, Or: I'm not sure how this'll work","content":"Hello ladies and gentlemen,<br /> <br /> I was rereading the kickstarter preview on 3e Dragonblooded, because I told a friend of mine about Exalted, he seemed very interested in it and particularly in the Dragonblooded (he's a bit A:tLA fan) and he was curious what they'd be like in Third editions.<br /> Now, when I was reading it through, I started wondering, how would you do Elemental Linguistic Charms, Elemental Resistance Charms or Elemental War Charms, and still make the different elements feel distinct?<br /> So... does anyone have any answers to that? Any examples maybe? Maybe just some ideas you have for the new Dragonblooded<br /> <br /> Thank you very much,<br /> WMG","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I made some Martial Arts for 3e, look at them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723442-survival-is-fury-the-monster-reborn-ex3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/632-while-my-guitar","name":"While My Guitar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T09:26:11-08:00","id":62233,"title":"","content":"Well, you can look at the existing examples for inspiration. They only cover one element each, but they tend to have a strong flavour of that element -- Wind-Carried Words is definitely an Air charm, for instance, and not just because of the name. A lot of them are going to be that sort of thing -- DB elemental expressions were never as direct and literal as Avatar's, and while I expect the &quot;bending&quot; style effects to be embellished somewhat for 3e, they're likely to remain a subset of what DBs can do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T09:37:23-08:00","id":62242,"title":"","content":"Also, I seem to recall comments by one of the Devs (or maybe a writer) indicating bending-style elemental manipulation could be found in Martial Arts styles. I'm not sure if the Dragon Styles will become more bending-like, or if it was about hypothetical martial arts or about non-Immaculate Martial Arts that will be in the books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T11:00:07-08:00","id":62320,"title":"","content":"This is admittedly fairly old (pretty sure it predates the Dragonblooded preview), but this was the thinking at some point:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>What We Know Wiki</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Q: Exalted 3rd Dragon-Blooded: can you speak to whether or not players will be able to evoke Avatar: TLA with the system as written? <b>(nicodemus144)</b></i><br /> <br /> A: Avatar evokes Dragon-Blooded. Just throwin' that out there. That said, I plan to introduce some more iconic elemental Charms to various abilities, and probably a new series of five (tentatively) DB-only martial arts. <b>(John M\u00f8rke)</b></div> </div> </div> </div>In the past, if not on this specific topic, the devs have expressed a disinterest in &quot;symmetry for the sake of symmetry.&quot; If some Abilities really aren't giving good grounds for a given element, they might not force Charms in there. If so, this will no doubt be done in such a way that all five elements have plenty of awesome things of their own in their respective toolboxes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T11:23:45-08:00","id":62336,"title":"","content":"I look at the thread title and the opening post, and I retort, &quot;Does it need to work?&quot; There's no obligation for an even-handed distribution of elementally oriented charms. That said, something tells me you won't be disappointed when the final product comes. As useless as it is to say, &quot;take this on faith.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>A Green Sun Destrier</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/77-kongurous","name":"kongurous","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar77_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"417"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T11:57:21-08:00","id":62352,"title":"","content":"I assume that most charms will have the primary element of the aspect they're associated with and the player can flavor with other elements as desired.<br /> <br /> 'My thunder strike is crashing tsunami strike' and so on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T12:21:38-08:00","id":62363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kongurous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/62216-dragonblooded-charms-3e-or-i-m-not-sure-how-this-ll-work?p=62336#post62336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I look at the thread title and the opening post, and I retort, &quot;Does it need to work?&quot; There's no obligation for an even-handed distribution of elementally oriented charms. That said, something tells me you won't be disappointed when the final product comes. As useless as it is to say, &quot;take this on faith.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Or if you're more pessimistic &quot;Wait, look at the core book, see how good a job they do on that and then project equivalent skill onto the DB book and guestimate how good it's going to be.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T12:40:39-08:00","id":62389,"title":"","content":"I don't think it necessarily has to be symmetric, it just has to not be a giant clusterfuck. I don't think it really hurts anybody if there is no specifically fire-themed Linguistics charm or an earth-themed Larceny charm, so long as long there is a big, solid framework in the form of general charms that can change depending on the elemental aspect of the given Dragonblooded. In the end I feel like Dragonblooded charms are the easiest to come up with, there is an endless supply of ideas for elemental charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2052,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","user":"FromBeyond","date":". 01-31-2014, 03:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T12:48:47-08:00","id":62394,"title":"","content":"NEW DRAGONBLOODED LINGUISTICS CHARM: ICE COLD BURN PRANA","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T12:55:37-08:00","id":62406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/62216-dragonblooded-charms-3e-or-i-m-not-sure-how-this-ll-work?p=62352#post62352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assume that most charms will have the primary element of the aspect they're associated with and the player can flavor with other elements as desired.<br /> <br /> 'My thunder strike is crashing tsunami strike' and so on.</div> </div> </div> </div>This makes sense, especially if they keep the &quot;Out of Aspect&quot; cost.<br /> <br /> ~ N","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is timing in everything. Timing in strategy cannot be mastered without a great deal of practice. There is also timing in the Void. You win battles with the timing in the Void born of the timing of cunning by knowing the enemies' timing, and thus using a timing which the enemy does not expect.&quot; <i>Shinmen Musashi no Kami Fujiwara no Genshin, Go Rin No Sho (The Book of the Five Rings)</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","name":"Nadrakas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T13:09:50-08:00","id":62418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nadrakas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/62216-dragonblooded-charms-3e-or-i-m-not-sure-how-this-ll-work?p=62406#post62406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This makes sense, especially if they keep the &quot;Out of Aspect&quot; cost.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really hope they change that actually.<br /> <br /> What makes more sense and encourages play &quot;Here's your aspect, here's how much charms cost, oh and because of your aspect here's a charge you have to add to 80% of everything you can do.&quot; or &quot;Here's your aspect, here's how much charms cost, oh and because you're awesome good at stuff you can use these 20% of all charms at a discount&quot;<br /> <br /> Using a surcharge on the majority is saying &quot;you inherently suck so bad we're taxing you&quot; using a discount on the minority is saying &quot;you are super awesome at this stuff&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T22:46:49-08:00","id":62736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/62216-dragonblooded-charms-3e-or-i-m-not-sure-how-this-ll-work?p=62418#post62418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really hope they change that actually.<br /> <br /> What makes more sense and encourages play &quot;Here's your aspect, here's how much charms cost, oh and because of your aspect here's a charge you have to add to 80% of everything you can do.&quot; or &quot;Here's your aspect, here's how much charms cost, oh and because you're awesome good at stuff you can use these 20% of all charms at a discount&quot;<br /> <br /> Using a surcharge on the majority is saying &quot;you inherently suck so bad we're taxing you&quot; using a discount on the minority is saying &quot;you are super awesome at this stuff&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, I hope that is changed too. &quot;Sigh&quot;...but for now, I don't know which direction things will go. I know things are malleable at the moment, but until we know more.<br /> <br /> <br /> ~ N","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is timing in everything. Timing in strategy cannot be mastered without a great deal of practice. There is also timing in the Void. You win battles with the timing in the Void born of the timing of cunning by knowing the enemies' timing, and thus using a timing which the enemy does not expect.&quot; <i>Shinmen Musashi no Kami Fujiwara no Genshin, Go Rin No Sho (The Book of the Five Rings)</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2141-nadrakas","name":"Nadrakas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2141_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T23:21:33-08:00","id":62744,"title":"","content":"Off the top of my head, some alternate-aspect Linguistic Charm concepts:<br /> <br /> Fire-aspected: Write a message that evokes unnatural emotions and passions in its readers. Create a meme that goes viral as swiftly as a forest fire. Create a message that consumes itself once read and acted on, burning itself out of a messenger's memory.<br /> <br /> Earth-aspected: Ensure that a meme survives intact, without changing, no matter how it's transmitted. Create an enduring story that will last generations. Write a story that puts anyone who reads it into a coma.<br /> <br /> Water-aspected: Write a message that reads differently to different people. Corrupt an existing message into uselessness or coopt it for yourself. Write a story that's always in the reader's native tongue.<br /> <br /> Wood-aspected: Write a text that learns and grows, letting you argue your points from afar. Create a manual that updates itself as new techniques are discovered and old ones become obselete. Create characters that really come to life.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/39-ysadrel","name":"ysadrel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T23:28:34-08:00","id":62745,"title":"","content":"Actually, you know what just came to mind?<br /> <br /> Give DB's three levels of Abilities/Charms: In-Aspect, out-of-Aspect, and *opposite Aspect*. Perhaps letting people pick their Opposite Aspect (the one with the surcharge) from two options per (e.g. the opposite of Fire is both Water and Air, or something), and probably not going with something as bland-yet-powerful as making in-Aspect Charms cost a mote less.<br /> <br /> Edit: Actually, let people pick their opposed Aspect. There's probably a good argument to be made for any given pair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":234,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/234-superg","user":"SuperG","date":". 02-01-2014, 02:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/234-superg","name":"SuperG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar234_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"451"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T01:49:50-08:00","id":62788,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/62216-dragonblooded-charms-3e-or-i-m-not-sure-how-this-ll-work?p=62745#post62745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, you know what just came to mind?<br /> <br /> Give DB's three levels of Abilities/Charms: In-Aspect, out-of-Aspect, and *opposite Aspect*. Perhaps letting people pick their Opposite Aspect (the one with the surcharge) from two options per (e.g. the opposite of Fire is both Water and Air, or something), and probably not going with something as bland-yet-powerful as making in-Aspect Charms cost a mote less.<br /> <br /> Edit: Actually, let people pick their opposed Aspect. There's probably a good argument to be made for any given pair.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like the Legend of the Five Rings vibe I'm getting from this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T06:19:10-08:00","id":62875,"title":"","content":"Not too long ago I was considering doing a rewrite of the DB Charmset, the main change being to give each Ability Charms of each element (this was before we heard about what Ex3 was doing). I went through all the Abilities coming up with Charm ideas. Here's what I had for Linguistics:<br /> <br /> Air: Send words a long distance, on the wind.<br /> Air: Write swiftly. Burn the writing into place with lightning.<br /> Air: Make voice louder and cover more distance, unto a thunderstorm.<br /> Earth: Concentrate writing down to a single iconic pictogram.<br /> Earth: Make a single word carry a conversation's worth of meaning.<br /> Earth: Lock away code behind impenetrable encryption.<br /> Earth: Communicate efficiently without words using hand gestures.<br /> Fire: Fill every word with great passion and meaning.<br /> Water: Take on the language of those around oneself.<br /> Wood: Link minds.<br /> Wood: Hijack a conversation to change the words as they're said.<br /> <br /> Note that a lot of what I did was simply take existing Charms and tag them with a different element. Cypher Missive, Craft Icon, and Speech Without Words, for example, became Earth Linguistics Charms, as they follow the Earth themes (as I decided them to be), of being able to give their words focus and concentration, a density like that onto the earth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T07:25:49-08:00","id":62898,"title":"","content":"Elements in Creation do have a support/opposition cycle like in Taoist elements if I remembe rright.<br /> <br /> <b>Support:</b><br /> - Air fuels FIre<br /> - Fire refreshes Earth<br /> - Earth directs Water<br /> - Water noursihes Wood<br /> - Wood cleanses Air<br /> <br /> <b>Opposition</b>:<br /> - Air freezes Water<br /> - Water douses Fire<br /> - Fire consumes Wood<br /> - Wood breaks Earth<br /> - Earth blocks Air<br /> <br /> I don't see this being the way to go with defining Charms, per se, but it seems like a neat thing to draw on. A five-pointed star, as i remember reading in the original <i>Making of Exalted</i> book, was actually a symbol of the Five Elements.<br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name"